### List all books
GET http://localhost:3000/books

### Search, sort, paginate and filter by price
GET http://localhost:3000/books?search_q=the&order_by=price&order=DESC&limit=5&offset=0&min_price=100&max_price=500

### Invalid sort column (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/books?order_by=password

### Invalid limit (expect 400)
GET http://localhost:3000/books?limit=0

### Get a book (change ID if needed)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1

### Missing book (expect 404)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/99999

### Create a book (expect 201)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Sample Book",
  "author": "Sample Author",
  "price": 299
}

### Invalid create: missing title (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Sample Author",
  "price": 299
}

### Invalid create: non-numeric price (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:3000/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Bad Price",
  "author": "Sample Author",
  "price": "abc"
}

### Update book (change ID if needed; expect 200)
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Book",
  "author": "Updated Author",
  "price": 350
}

### Delete book (change ID if needed; expect 200)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/1
